# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PORT REGISTRY — trini-thrive-be
# Every service port must be unique. Check this list before adding a new service.
# ── Existing shared services (do not modify) ──
# api (gateway)                       = 3000
# location-service                    = 3010
# ── Hopecard services ──
# hopecard-admin-service              = 3101
# hopecard-beneficiary-service        = 3102
# hopecard-campaign-manager-service   = 3103
# hopecard-donor-service              = 3104
# hopecard-notification-service       = 3105
# ── Future systems — claim a range and document it here ──
# Damayan:   3201–3299
# BayaniHub: 3301–3399
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

